+
+## 2. Service: validation order, normalization, and discount arithmetic
+
+- [x] 2.1 Implement `OrderService.applyCoupon(id, couponCode)` with `CouponRepository` injected, normalizing the code (trim + uppercase) and evaluating conditions in TASK.md §6 order, throwing the matching `AppError` for each. Verify with new tests asserting `INVALID_REQUEST`, `ORDER_NOT_FOUND`, `ORDER_NOT_PENDING`, `COUPON_ALREADY_APPLIED`, `COUPON_NOT_FOUND`, `COUPON_INACTIVE`, `COUPON_NOT_YET_VALID`, `COUPON_EXPIRED`, `COUPON_USAGE_EXHAUSTED`, `MINIMUM_NOT_MET`.
+- [x] 2.2 Implement the discount helper: `FIXED` uses `value`; `PERCENT` uses `Math.floor(amountCents * value / 100)`; apply `maxDiscountCents` when non-null; clamp to `amountCents`; set `finalAmountCents = amountCents - discount`. Verify with tests for AC-01 through AC-06 (including AC-05 rounding and AC-07 boundary `now == validFrom` success / `now == validUntil` expired).
+- [x] 2.3 Verify code normalization accepts `" save20 "` for `SAVE20` (AC-10) with a service test.
+
+## 3. Route and wiring
+
+- [x] 3.1 Register `POST /orders/:id/apply-coupon` in `src/routes/orders.ts`, parse the id with `parseId`, and call the service. Verify with an integration test that a successful call returns HTTP 200 and a body deep-equal to a subsequent `GET /orders/:id` (AC-14 / REQ-14).
+- [x] 3.2 Wire `CouponRepository` into `OrderService` in `src/app.ts`. Verify `npm run build` succeeds.
+- [x] 3.3 Verify AC-08 (second application returns 409 `COUPON_ALREADY_APPLIED` with unchanged amounts) and AC-09 (`GET /coupons/:code` `usedCount` increases by one and a `coupon_redemptions` row is added) with integration tests.
+
+## 4. Final verification
+
+- [x] 4.1 Run `npm test` and `npm run build`; confirm all tests pass and type checking is clean, including the untouched existing tests.
